
>> animal := Ntho ncha. 
 
 animal ha-ho-fihla: ['name:'] etsa: { :n
ea-hao lebitso := n.
}. 


animal name: ['Diva']. 
 
animal ha-ho-fihla: ['lebitso'] etsa: { <- lebitso.
}.

>> cat := animal ncha.
 
 cat name: ['Diva']. 
 
 cat ha-ho-fihla: ['lebitso'] etsa: { <- ['your royal highness ']
+ (uena lebitso).
}.

Sephetho ngola: cat lebitso.
